{"id":"es-A1-1-01","lang":"es","level":"A1","genre":"literature","topic":"a cat at home","title":"El gato de Ana","titleEn":"Ana's cat","text":"Ana tiene un gato. El gato se llama Tito.\n\nTito come pescado y duerme mucho.","translation":"Ana has a cat. The cat is called Tito.\n\nTito eats fish and sleeps a lot.","questions":[{"q":"What is the text about?","options":["Ana's cat","Ana's dog","A fish shop","A school"],"answer":0,"explain":"The text starts 'Ana tiene un gato'."},{"q":"What is the cat called?","options":["Ana","Pepe","Tito","Luis"],"answer":2,"explain":"'El gato se llama Tito.'"},{"q":"What does Tito eat?","options":["Rice","Fish","Bread","Fruit"],"answer":1,"explain":"'Tito come pescado.'"},{"q":"What does 'duerme' mean?","options":["eats","runs","plays","sleeps"],"answer":3,"explain":"Tito 'duerme mucho': he sleeps a lot."}]}
{"id":"es-A1-1-02","lang":"es","level":"A1","genre":"science","topic":"the sun and the moon","title":"El sol","titleEn":"The sun","text":"El sol es una estrella. Es muy grande y muy caliente.","translation":"The sun is a star. It is very big and very hot.","questions":[{"q":"What is the text about?","options":["The sea","The sun","A city","A tree"],"answer":1,"explain":"'El sol es una estrella.'"},{"q":"What is the sun?","options":["A planet","A moon","A star","A cloud"],"answer":2,"explain":"'Es una estrella.'"},{"q":"How is the sun?","options":["Small and cold","Big and cold","Small and hot","Big and hot"],"answer":3,"explain":"'Muy grande y muy caliente.'"},{"q":"What does 'caliente' mean?","options":["hot","old","far","dark"],"answer":0,"explain":"The sun is 'muy caliente': very hot."}]}
